# AGENTS.md (shared-types package)

This package inherits all rules from the repository root `AGENTS.md`.

## Package Scope

Shared TypeScript types and contracts.

## Commands

```bash
{{packageManager}} --filter shared-types run test
{{packageManager}} --filter shared-types run build
```

## Notes

- Changes here affect every consumer package.
- Treat updates as contract changes and update tests accordingly.
